{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "155", "x": 0.8947456268749892, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03899762172864659, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): Okay. So loneliness and depression are clearly related. and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.8260584445549664, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "that's been recognized by various governments around the world. But unlike", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.8268489119488015, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "depression, loneliness has no recognized clinical form.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.5617067708402217, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): There's no available diagnosis or effective treatments, and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.8262990706215463, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "that's not likely to change.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.27927043858022216, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): I don't think so either. I was thinking we should start our", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.8260968914126432, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "presentation with an example from our own experience. I'd like to talk about how", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.8259550994015311, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "lonely I was when I started university. being away from home for the first time and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.8261206772019258, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "all that.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.08772639944767757, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): Good idea. Everyone will be able to relate to that. Although a lot", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.826344386651128, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "of students were probably too embarrassed to admit to it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.5945630965734827, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): Yeah, we could discuss ways of dealing with loneliness as", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8263440790762666, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "well, like just talking to strangers.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.3548600621526775, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): Loads of studies have shown that interactions with shop", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8263398755531606, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "assistants and bar staff make people feel more optimistic and rel Next.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.7302715845016308, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): I don't know about that, but it must make people feel more", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.8261998264662632, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "connected with their community.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.34276570597709205, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): True. Although, you need to be a certain kind of person to be able", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.8268198973868748, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "to just strike up a conversation.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.32744622232966836, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): Good point. We should say something about solitude and how", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.8263460270503888, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "being alone and being lonely aren't the same thing. It's strange the way some", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.8260772066215126, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "people can't stand being by themselves while others love it.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.614972277765116, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): Yeah. Yeah, the research shows a certain amount of solitude is", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8259830887139198, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "beneficial for well-being, which I appreciate, but being alone isn't something I", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.8261336978710591, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "actually like. I'd never choose to go on holiday alone, for example.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.6756455201772698, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): Me neither.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.3367185791517762, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): Well, let's not.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.33208240074072226, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}], "source": "pdf text layer"}